OL,3,GNEWSAThe gang murder and the women who
OL,4,Awent to the White House looking for
OL,5,Aanswers
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is a Sunday night in the pub.
OL,9,FThere is football on the TV and people
OL,10,Fpacked around the bar - then suddenly,
OL,11,Fviolence erupts.
OL,13,FBottles are smashed and broken glass is
OL,14,Fslashed across the throat of one of the
OL,15,Fbiggest men in the bar.
OL,17,FThe melee spills out into the street,
OL,18,Fwhere the injured man says out loud the
OL,19,Fname of the man he believes attacked
OL,20,Fhim.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
